OL,3,GNEWSADancers, DJs and drummers as
OL,4,ANotting Hill Carnival celebrates 60th
OL,5,Aanniversary
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe final day of this year's Notting
OL,8,FHill Carnival sees dancers, DJs and
OL,9,Fdrummers fill the streets of west
OL,10,FLondon - take a look at some colourful
OL,11,Fimages of the costumes and floats
OL,13,FThe three-day event celebrates
OL,14,FCaribbean arts and culture and normally
OL,15,Fattracts about two million people each
OL,16,Fyear - here's more on the deeper
OL,17,Fmeaning behind the visual spectacle
OL,19,FOn Sunday, 169 arrests were made, but
OL,20,Fpolice described the mood as
OL,21,F"overwhelmingly positive and
OL,22,Fcelebratory"
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
